From 50519ca834bce10fae5eae1b461075d123058954 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:35:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 52/55] Drone tracks: a drone row's pad pressed while its note
 plays only selects it

Pressed during a sequenced note, a pad does a "silent" audition: InstrumentClipView::startAuditioningRow() still sent
the audition note-on first and reassessAllAuditionStatus() the note-off at once. A sound drum shrugs that off; a drone
row has one gate, which that closed, so the row went silent until its next note, just as one presses its pad to select
it and turn its pitch. For drone rows the note-on isn't sent then, so nothing is closed (found in the fix round of the
review; drone_edit_emu.py: row 0 still at its lane's 300 Hz after its pad, the build before: silent).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Eb214cM1zi1k5Gpcn9RLKh
---
 src/deluge/gui/views/instrument_clip_view.cpp | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/deluge/gui/views/instrument_clip_view.cpp b/src/deluge/gui/views/instrument_clip_view.cpp
index 09c346c4..22d93e7e 100644
--- a/src/deluge/gui/views/instrument_clip_view.cpp
+++ b/src/deluge/gui/views/instrument_clip_view.cpp
@@ -3912,6 +3912,11 @@ bool InstrumentClipView::startAuditioningRow(int32_t velocity, int32_t yDisplay,
 		}
 	}
 
+	// mastertune-v16: a drone row playing from the sequence is only selected (to turn its pitch, say). Its one gate
+	// isn't opened for the audition and closed again right away by the silent audition below, which silenced the row
+	// until its next note
+	bool sequencedDrone = doSilentAudition && isKit && drum != nullptr && drum->type == DrumType::DRONE;
+
 	// If won't be actually sounding Instrument...
 	if (shiftButtonDown || Buttons::isButtonPressed(deluge::hid::button::Y_ENC)) {
 
@@ -3920,7 +3925,7 @@ bool InstrumentClipView::startAuditioningRow(int32_t velocity, int32_t yDisplay,
 		doSilentAudition = true;
 	}
 	else {
-		if (!auditioningSilently) {
+		if (!auditioningSilently && !sequencedDrone) {
 
 			fileBrowserShouldNotPreview = false;
 
-- 
